{"type": "text", "text": "The book's rule: the value of your holding stays the same. Real prices move a little with demand and supply."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Open this chapter's study page to try it."}]}]}}, "index": "amhCU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 493.3333333333333, "y": 491, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3m", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Excess cash", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " and too few profitable investments"}]}]}}, "index": "a8KnE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 586.4799999999959, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4n", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "5.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Payout ratio = DPS ÷ EPS."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a8zrL", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 689, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-f", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"color": "light-green", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ANALOGY", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A record date is like a school's attendance register on prize day. Whoever is on the register that morning gets the prize, even if they leave the school the next week."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 120, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aCY2A", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:IbQjS9dRuaC_lRP_ZskFl", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-48", "toId": "shape:ch09-45", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "end"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1714.3999999999942, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1l", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The "}, {"type": "text", "text": "reverse", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " of a split. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Consolidation", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " increases face value in a set ratio and reduces the number of shares, keeping paid-up capital the same. Consolidation "}, {"type": "text", "text": "5:1", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " means five shares become one. The book's example: 500 shares of Rs 2 become 100 shares of Rs 10."}]}]}}, "index": "aC7Cj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 2899.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2m", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EXAM TRAP", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Watch the ratio wording. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Bonus 1:3", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " = 1 new share for every 3 held. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Split 1:5", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " = 1 share becomes 5. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Consolidation 5:1", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " = 5 shares become 1."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 72, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "anBe6", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 930.6666666666666, "y": 491, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3n", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A "}, {"type": "text", "text": "confidence-building", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " measure"}]}]}}, "index": "a9M4b", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 1679.9199999999983, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-50", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "18.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Scheme of arrangement: section 230, Companies Act 2013; approach the NCLT; covers all restructuring including M&A."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 24, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aLMqr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 586.4799999999959, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4o", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "6.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Book: 10% tax deducted on dividend income above Rs 5,000. No dividend distribution tax from AY 2021-22."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a9dIU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 0, "y": 2089.6, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-g", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 2836.7999999999956, "name": "9.2 Dividend", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a2LVn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1836.3999999999942, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1m", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Companies consolidate when the share price is so low that it hurts how investors see the company. A higher price can improve that perception."}]}]}}, "index": "aDGKb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 3080, "y": 788.6, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2n", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 3193.800000000003, "name": "9.7 Mergers and acquisitions", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a4C7b", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 280, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-40", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 174, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "red", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Compulsory", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Because the company did not comply with regulations or the listing agreement."}]}]}}, "index": "a5zys", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 629, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3o", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A "}, {"type": "text", "text": "defence", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " against a possible takeover"}]}]}}, "index": "aAKRU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 1679.9199999999983, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-51", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "19.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Buyback only out of reserves and surplus; shares extinguished; special resolution with time frame and maximum price."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 48, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aMQjr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 586.4799999999959, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4p", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "7.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " A rights issue must be offered to existing shareholders first (Companies Act)."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aAuEb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 56, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-h", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"w": 128, "h": 128, "geo": "ellipse", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "white", "fill": "fill", "size": "l", "font": "sans", "align": "middle", "verticalAlign": "middle", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.2", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a1ZUm", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1940.3999999999942, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1n", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bonus, split and consolidation side by side"}]}]}}, "index": "aE9lf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 974, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-30", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 144, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Diversification", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Into a new geography or a complementary business."}]}]}}, "index": "aDEgv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 56, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2o", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"w": 128, "h": 128, "geo": "ellipse", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "white", "fill": "fill", "size": "l", "font": "sans", "align": "middle", "verticalAlign": "middle", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.7", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a11zm", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 280, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-41", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 174, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Voluntary", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The company chooses to go private: to escape reporting complexity, after a merger or acquisition, or for freedom to change strategy. Must follow SEBI's regulations."}]}]}}, "index": "a6UnY", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 493.3333333333333, "y": 629, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3p", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reduce equity and so "}, {"type": "text", "text": "increase leverage", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aB5UR", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1040, "y": 1679.9199999999983, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-52", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "20.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Buyback raises EPS for remaining shareholders even with no change in profit."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aNsbr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1040, "y": 586.4799999999959, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4q", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "8.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Rights: discount to market price; can be renounced; trade on the exchange."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aBNt2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-i", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dividend"}]}]}}, "index": "a2zkg", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1074.3466666666668, "y": 2245.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-20", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Goes up"}]}]}}, "index": "aRzv9", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2015.3999999999942, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1o", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "All three are book entries. The value of your holding does not change."}]}]}}, "index": "aFcm6", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 974, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-31", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 144, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Taxation", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A profitable company buys a loss-making one to use its losses as a tax shield."}]}]}}, "index": "aEYrI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2p", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Mergers and acquisitions"}]}]}}, "index": "a24tf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 494, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-42", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Voluntary delisting: reverse book building"}]}]}}, "index": "a7dyv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 930.6666666666666, "y": 629, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3q", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Offset "}, {"type": "text", "text": "dilution", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " of promoters' holding, for example from ESOPs"}]}]}}, "index": "aC1yr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2080.8800000000047, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-53", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "21.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Voluntary delisting: reverse book building; promoter holding must cross 90%; at least 25% of public shareholders must take part."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 48, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aOVQn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 914.4799999999959, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4r", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Rights issue open 15 to 30 days; abridged letter of offer at least 3 days before opening; draft filed with SEBI."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 24, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aCThE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.79999999999927, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-j", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 9 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3n8E", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1104.5, "y": 1800.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-10", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"w": 239.5, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "green", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Result", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "More shares outstanding, more cash on the balance sheet"}]}]}}, "index": "aKOwb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2355.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-21", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Share capital", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aSqEQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2073.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1p", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}}, "index": "aGf5f", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1144, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-32", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "When an acquirer, and persons acting in concert with it, substantially acquire shares and voting rights in a listed company, SEBI's takeover regulations (named in the book as the SEBI (Substantial Acquisition of Shares and Takeover) Regulations, 1997) set the triggers and give public shareholders a chance to "}, {"type": "text", "text": "exit", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " if they wish."}]}]}}, "index": "aF6pn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2q", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 9 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3wyA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 569, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-43", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "As per the book"}]}]}}, "index": "a8mln", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 769, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3r", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The book adds: every management talks up the benefits to minority shareholders, but its real intention is very hard to judge."}]}]}}, "index": "aDKo2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 2080.8800000000047, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-54", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "22.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Remaining holders can sell at the exit price for one year after delisting."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aPBzm", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 914.4799999999959, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4s", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "10.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Bonus = equity dividend = capitalisation of reserves. Not from revaluation reserves."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aDOFn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-k", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Post-tax profit belongs to shareholders. A company can "}, {"type": "text", "text": "retain", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " it for the business or "}, {"type": "text", "text": "return", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " it. Returning money to all shareholders in equal proportion is "}, {"type": "text", "text": "declaring a dividend", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Most companies do some of each. How much they pay depends on opportunities to reinvest, the nature of management, shareholders' expectations and, finally, the cash available."}]}]}}, "index": "a4xK2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 175.75, "y": 1932.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-11", "type": "arrow", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"kind": "arc", "elbowMidPoint": 0.5, "dash": "draw", "size": "m", "fill": "none", "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "bend": 0, "start": {"x": 0, "y": 0}, "end": {"x": 349.5, "y": 0}, "arrowheadStart": "none", "arrowheadEnd": "arrow", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}, "labelPosition": 0.5, "font": "draw", "scale": 1}, "index": "aIoUiV", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 333.65333333333336, "y": 2355.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-22", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 455.04, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Goes up (reserves capitalised)"}]}]}}, "index": "aTEqz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 333.65333333333336, "y": 2073.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1q", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 455.04, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bonus issue", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aHGJA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1280, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-33", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.8 Demerger or spin-off"}]}]}}, "index": "aGw8j", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2r", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "These change the ownership structure of the companies involved."}]}]}}, "index": "a4j4n", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 627, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-44", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"w": 239.5, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Floor price", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Promoters invite bids and set a floor price"}]}]}}, "index": "a9bQb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 873, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3s", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The rules (as per the book)"}]}]}}, "index": "aECcE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 2080.8800000000047, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-55", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "23.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Relisting: 5 years after voluntary delisting, 10 years after compulsory."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aQ1WQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 914.4799999999959, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4t", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "11.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " No bonus if the company has defaulted on interest or principal on debt securities or fixed deposits."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aE3QX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 376, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-l", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "During the year", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Interim dividend", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a5Mff", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 525.25, "y": 1932.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-12", "type": "arrow", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"kind": "arc", "elbowMidPoint": 0.5, "dash": "draw", "size": "m", "fill": "none", "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "bend": 0, "start": {"x": 0, "y": 0}, "end": {"x": 349.5, "y": 0}, "arrowheadStart": "none", "arrowheadEnd": "arrow", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}, "labelPosition": 0.5, "font": "draw", "scale": 1}, "index": "aJyuEV", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 796.6933333333334, "y": 2355.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-23", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No change"}]}]}}, "index": "aUNBM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 796.6933333333334, "y": 2073.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1r", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Stock split", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aI4DU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1355, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-34", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A "}, {"type": "text", "text": "spin-off", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " carves one or more businesses out into a separate company. Shareholders on the record date get shares in the new company "}, {"type": "text", "text": "in proportion", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " to their holding in the parent."}]}]}}, "index": "aH5Gj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 294, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2s", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Merger, acquisition, consolidation"}]}]}}, "index": "a5l4v", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 405.5, "y": 627, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-45", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"w": 239.5, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Shareholders bid", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Each states the price at which they will sell"}]}]}}, "index": "aAv3E", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:K7m32jEIeefFaUE2-oLij", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-13", "toId": "shape:ch09-z", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "start"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 56, "y": 948, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3t", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Only out of "}, {"type": "text", "text": "reserves and surplus", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bought-back shares are "}, {"type": "text", "text": "extinguished", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " within a set time, so share capital falls."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Not allowed if the company has defaulted on interest or principal of debentures, fixed deposits or other borrowings, on redeeming preference shares, or on paying a declared dividend."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Methods: a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "tender offer", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " to existing shareholders on a proportionate basis; the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "open market", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " through book building or the stock exchange; or from "}, {"type": "text", "text": "odd-lot holders", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Needs a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "special resolution", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " stating the time frame and the maximum price."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "aFfWA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1040, "y": 2080.8800000000047, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-56", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "24.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Share swap: acquirer pays in its own shares; a fair swap ratio needs both companies valued."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aRfXA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1040, "y": 914.4799999999959, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4u", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "12.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Bonus 1:3 = 1 new for every 3 held. Split 1:5 = 1 becomes 5. Consolidation 5:1 = 5 become 1."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aFHhU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 376, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-m", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "At year end", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Final dividend", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a61Pz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"name": "", "color": "#9D5BD2", "imageUrl": "", "meta": {}, "id": "user:bsitiMKqSn4llL82CM9Zt", "typeName": "user"}, {"x": 874.75, "y": 1932.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-13", "type": "arrow", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"kind": "arc", "elbowMidPoint": 0.5, "dash": "draw", "size": "m", "fill": "none", "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "bend": 0, "start": {"x": 0, "y": 0}, "end": {"x": 349.5, "y": 0}, "arrowheadStart": "none", "arrowheadEnd": "arrow", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}, "labelPosition": 0.5, "font": "draw", "scale": 1}, "index": "aLe42", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1074.3466666666668, "y": 2355.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-24", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No change"}]}]}}, "index": "aVxt2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1074.3466666666668, "y": 2073.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1s", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Consolidation", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aJZYE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 1355, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-35", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "light-blue", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The book's Adani example", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "In "}, {"type": "text", "text": "April 2018", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", Adani Enterprises spun off its renewable energy business as "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Adani Green Energy", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", giving shareholders new shares in the ratio "}, {"type": "text", "text": "761:1000", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (761 Adani Green shares for every 1,000 Adani Enterprises shares). Earlier, in "}, {"type": "text", "text": "June 2015", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", it spun off its ports and its power transmission businesses as "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Adani Ports", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " and "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Adani Transmission", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 456, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aIeyX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 369, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2t", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Who survives?"}]}]}}, "index": "a6sSM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 755, "y": 627, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-46", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"w": 239.5, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Promoters decide", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Accept, reject (cancel the delisting) or make a counter-offer"}]}]}}, "index": "aBZHE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 948, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3u", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"color": "light-blue", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Why EPS rises", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fewer shares share the same profit. Even with no change in the P&L, EPS goes up for the shareholders who remain, and they may get a higher dividend per share. If the market values the company on earnings, the value per share also rises."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 240, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aG7Tz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 6160, "y": 3442.440000000011, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-57", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 982.9600000000064, "name": "For the group discussion", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a8XKQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1278.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4v", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "13.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Split and consolidation leave share capital unchanged; face value moves the other way to the number of shares."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 48, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aGFPM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 516, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-n", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A dividend must be paid within "}, {"type": "text", "text": "30 days", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " of declaration."}]}]}}, "index": "a791j", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2090.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-14", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Subscribing is a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "choice", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", not compulsory. Rights entitlements also trade on the stock exchange for a set period."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rights shares are usually priced at a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "discount", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " to market price. Logically, if the rights price were higher, investors would just buy in the market."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Shareholders may apply for "}, {"type": "text", "text": "extra", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " shares beyond their entitlement, from rights that others do not take up."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "aMy82", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2441.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-25", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Per-share data (EPS, book value, price)", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aW8sU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2159.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1t", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Number of shares", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aKrVj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2247.800000000003, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-36", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.9 Scheme of arrangement"}]}]}}, "index": "aJ9gA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 427, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2u", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Merger", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Target is absorbed", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The acquirer buys the target's shares. The target is absorbed into the acquirer and "}, {"type": "text", "text": "ceases to exist", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Its assets and liabilities pass to the acquirer."}]}]}}, "index": "a7cHX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1104.5, "y": 627, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-47", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"w": 239.5, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "green", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Delisting succeeds only if", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Promoter holding crosses "}, {"type": "text", "text": "90%", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", and at least "}, {"type": "text", "text": "25%", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " of public shareholders took part"}]}]}}, "index": "aCwjM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 4620, "y": 2504.6, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3v", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 1662.3999999999942, "name": "9.12 Delisting and relisting", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a6HY6", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 56, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-58", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-57", "props": {"w": 128, "h": 128, "geo": "ellipse", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "white", "fill": "fill", "size": "l", "font": "sans", "align": "middle", "verticalAlign": "middle", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "?", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a1eg6", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 1278.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4w", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "14.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Bonus and split: per-share data falls. Consolidation: per-share data rises. Ownership share never changes."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 24, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aHbHA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 588, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-o", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Declared in rupees per share"}]}]}}, "index": "a8vYb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2258.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-15", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The rules for a listed company (as per the book)"}]}]}}, "index": "aNl1f", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 333.65333333333336, "y": 2441.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-26", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 455.04, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Falls"}]}]}}, "index": "aXAVb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 333.65333333333336, "y": 2159.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1u", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 455.04, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Goes up"}]}]}}, "index": "aLUx1", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2322.800000000003, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-37", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "When a company cannot meet its obligations to creditors or to a class of shareholders (for example, failing to redeem preference shares), the company and its creditors or members can agree a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "scheme of arrangement", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}}, "index": "aK1Sr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 493.3333333333333, "y": 427, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2v", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Acquisition (takeover)", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Both carry on", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The acquirer buys all or a substantial part of the target's stock. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Both entities", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " typically continue to exist."}]}]}}, "index": "a8zCc", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 175.75, "y": 759, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-48", "type": "arrow", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"kind": "arc", "elbowMidPoint": 0.5, "dash": "draw", "size": "m", "fill": "none", "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "bend": 0, "start": {"x": 0, "y": 0}, "end": {"x": 349.5, "y": 0}, "arrowheadStart": "none", "arrowheadEnd": "arrow", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}, "labelPosition": 0.5, "font": "draw", "scale": 1}, "index": "aAyLS4", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 56, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3w", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"w": 128, "h": 128, "geo": "ellipse", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "white", "fill": "fill", "size": "l", "font": "sans", "align": "middle", "verticalAlign": "middle", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.12", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a1EiM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-59", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-57", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "For the group discussion"}]}]}}, "index": "a21Rb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 1278.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4x", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "15.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Merger: target ceases to exist. Acquisition: both continue. Consolidation: a new company, old ones cease."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aIAGU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 663, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-p", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "SEBI requires listed companies to declare dividends in "}, {"type": "text", "text": "rupees per share", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", not as a percentage of face value. The book's example: a 50% dividend means Re 1 on a Rs 2 share (company A) but Rs 5 on a Rs 10 share (company B). Same percentage, different money. So A now declares \"Re 1 per share\" and B declares \"Rs 5 per share\"."}]}]}}, "index": "a9ok6", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2333.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-16", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"w": 490, "h": 234, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fix a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "record date", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " for eligibility"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Issue a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "letter of offer", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " stating the purpose of the funds"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "File the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "draft", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " letter of offer with "}, {"type": "text", "text": "SEBI", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "aOMdb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 796.6933333333334, "y": 2441.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-27", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Falls"}]}]}}, "index": "aYLMf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 796.6933333333334, "y": 2159.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1v", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Goes up"}]}]}}, "index": "aMvKE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2412.800000000003, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-38", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A "}, {"type": "text", "text": "court-monitored", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " settlement. Usually reorganises share capital: shareholders may give up part of their ownership to creditors, or classes of shares may be consolidated or divided."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Under "}, {"type": "text", "text": "section 230 of the Companies Act, 2013", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", it can be sought by the company, its creditors or its members."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The term covers "}, {"type": "text", "text": "all types of corporate restructuring", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", including mergers and acquisitions. Using it in bankruptcy is just one use."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The applicant approaches the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "National Company Law Tribunal (NCLT)", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", which orders meetings of the company, creditors and members to reach a compromise."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "aLlon", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 930.6666666666666, "y": 427, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2w", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Consolidation", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A new company is born", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Companies combine to form a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "new company", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", and the merged companies cease to exist."}]}]}}, "index": "a9dvX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 525.25, "y": 759, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-49", "type": "arrow", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"kind": "arc", "elbowMidPoint": 0.5, "dash": "draw", "size": "m", "fill": "none", "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "bend": 0, "start": {"x": 0, "y": 0}, "end": {"x": 349.5, "y": 0}, "arrowheadStart": "none", "arrowheadEnd": "arrow", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}, "labelPosition": 0.5, "font": "draw", "scale": 1}, "index": "aBxEoV", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3x", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Delisting and relisting"}]}]}}, "index": "a23qU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1040, "y": 1278.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4y", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "16.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " M&A motives: synergy, revenue and market share, diversification, taxation."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aJgdf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 663, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-q", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EXAM TRAP", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 3 taught that a dividend stated as a percentage is a percentage of "}, {"type": "text", "text": "face value", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Chapter 9 adds that SEBI now wants listed companies to state it in "}, {"type": "text", "text": "rupees per share", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", to avoid that confusion."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 192, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aAPVI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 570, "y": 2333.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-17", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"w": 490, "h": 234, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Send an "}, {"type": "text", "text": "abridged", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " letter of offer at least "}, {"type": "text", "text": "3 days", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " before the issue opens"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Investors may apply on "}, {"type": "text", "text": "plain paper", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " if they do not get the form"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Open for a minimum of "}, {"type": "text", "text": "15 days", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " and a maximum of "}, {"type": "text", "text": "30 days", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "aPMw6", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1074.3466666666668, "y": 2441.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-28", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rises"}]}]}}, "index": "aZnIj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1074.3466666666668, "y": 2159.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1w", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Goes down"}]}]}}, "index": "aNBzo", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2676.800000000003, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-39", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.10 Loan restructuring"}]}]}}, "index": "aMB4z", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 731, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2x", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Why companies merge: four motives"}]}]}}, "index": "aAUmB", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3y", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 9 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3WEr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1679.9199999999983, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4z", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "17.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Spin-off: new shares in proportion to holdings. Adani Green: 761:1000 (April 2018)."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aKEUo", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1198.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-r", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A company's dividend track record can be seen from its "}, {"type": "text", "text": "payout ratio", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " = dividend per share ÷ earnings per share."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dividends are now fully taxable in the hands of shareholders. As per the book, the company deducts "}, {"type": "text", "text": "10%", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " tax (under section 194 of the Income Tax Act) on dividend income of more than "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rs 5,000", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " when paying it."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "From assessment year "}, {"type": "text", "text": "2021-22", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", a domestic company no longer pays dividend distribution tax."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "aBkkn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 2333.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-18", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EXAM TRAP", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If every shareholder takes up their full rights, each one's "}, {"type": "text", "text": "proportion of ownership stays the same", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "; only the number of shares goes up. Dilution hits only those who do not subscribe."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 144, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aQQwv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2551.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-29", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your share of ownership", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aaYHf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2245.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1x", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Face value", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aOhMQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 806, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2y", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 144, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Synergy", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Combined strengths give bigger benefits: economies of scale, forward and backward integration, a bigger market."}]}]}}, "index": "aBz8m", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3z", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Delisting", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " is the permanent removal of a company's shares from a stock exchange."}]}]}}, "index": "a493Q", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 0, "y": 788.6, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 1161, "name": "9.1 The ground rules", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a1vlj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1366.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-s", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.3 Rights issue"}]}]}}, "index": "aCA2Q", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1540, "y": 788.6, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-19", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 3308.9999999999927, "name": "9.4 Bonus issue", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a3OxE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 333.65333333333336, "y": 2245.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1y", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 455.04, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Not discussed in the book. It says reserves move into paid-up capital"}]}]}}, "index": "aPXXv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 806, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2z", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 144, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Revenue and market share", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Two competitors combining gain revenue and share."}]}]}}, "index": "aCE6U", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 56, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"w": 128, "h": 128, "geo": "ellipse", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "white", "fill": "fill", "size": "l", "font": "sans", "align": "middle", "verticalAlign": "middle", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.1", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a1WJI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1441.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-t", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A company that needs more equity can ask existing shareholders or bring in new investors. New investors "}, {"type": "text", "text": "dilute", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " existing holders. The book's example: a company with 10 lakh shares of Rs 10 (capital Rs 1 crore) issues 10 lakh more to new investors. Capital doubles, so existing holders' share is "}, {"type": "text", "text": "halved", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}}, "index": "aDWoz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:_svstPhH8ER2iDQ6lmNTD", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-12", "toId": "shape:ch09-y", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "start"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 796.6933333333334, "y": 2245.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1z", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Goes down"}]}]}}, "index": "aQ3uQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The ground rules"}]}]}}, "index": "a22sQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1563.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-u", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "To prevent this, the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Companies Act", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " requires a company raising more capital through shares to "}, {"type": "text", "text": "first offer them to existing shareholders", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". That offer is a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "rights issue", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}}, "index": "aEBtI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:rr-sIYOyvU0UZmsyhiTFt", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-12", "toId": "shape:ch09-z", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "end"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.79999999999927, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-6", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 9 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3Ve2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1667.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-v", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A rights issue, step by step"}]}]}}, "index": "aF0cI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:N-nH1BhLO2c6YdpMuFcZy", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-4a", "toId": "shape:ch09-47", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "end"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:tMdh-XqIgp98gT9oihggo", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-48", "toId": "shape:ch09-44", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "start"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-7", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Corporate actions", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " are actions a company takes, apart from its business, that directly affect its stakeholders: paying dividends, issuing more shares, buybacks, mergers and acquisitions, restructuring, delisting, raising debt and others. Once a company has made a public issue, the interests of "}, {"type": "text", "text": "minority investors", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " must be protected."}]}]}}, "index": "a4y1X", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1742.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-w", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The book's example: shareholder A holds 10 shares priced at Rs 100"}]}]}}, "index": "aG4ln", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5a", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-57", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pick one each. Argue it out"}]}]}}, "index": "a36Xb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 344, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-8", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Corporate actions are regulated by three sets of rules:"}]}]}}, "index": "a5X3v", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1800.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-x", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"w": 239.5, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Offer", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1-for-2 rights at Rs 70: one new share for every two held"}]}]}}, "index": "aHmtA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 874.75, "y": 759, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4a", "type": "arrow", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"kind": "arc", "elbowMidPoint": 0.5, "dash": "draw", "size": "m", "fill": "none", "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "bend": 0, "start": {"x": 0, "y": 0}, "end": {"x": 349.5, "y": 0}, "arrowheadStart": "none", "arrowheadEnd": "arrow", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}, "labelPosition": 0.5, "font": "draw", "scale": 1}, "index": "aDFw6", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5b", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-57", "props": {"color": "light-violet", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " If a bonus issue does not change the value of your holding, why do share prices often rise when a bonus is announced?"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 24, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a4QNb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 402, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-9", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Companies Act, 2013", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a6G3v", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 405.5, "y": 1800.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-y", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"w": 239.5, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Entitlement", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A can buy 5 more shares at Rs 70"}]}]}}, "index": "aIE5X", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2751.800000000003, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3a", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A company in financial distress, unable to pay its lenders, can change one or more terms of its loans: the amount, the interest rate, the mode of repayment (cash or equity), or the term. The aim is repayment within the borrower's capacity."}]}]}}, "index": "aNjn2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 917, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4b", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "SEBI requires promoters to give "}, {"type": "text", "text": "all shareholders an exit", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " opportunity."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Public shareholders still holding shares after delisting can sell them to the promoters at the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "exit price", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " within "}, {"type": "text", "text": "one year", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No minority shareholder can be "}, {"type": "text", "text": "forced", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " to exit."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "aEF9A", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5c", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-57", "props": {"color": "light-violet", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " A cash-rich company announces a buyback instead of a dividend. Which would you prefer as a shareholder, and why?"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 48, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a5ByE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 755, "y": 1800.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-z", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-g", "props": {"w": 239.5, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Choices", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Subscribe, apply for extra shares, let it lapse, or "}, {"type": "text", "text": "renounce", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (transfer the right, for money or for free)"}]}]}}, "index": "aJLGr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:xfWl0h8t9RB2y5MeHHPHU", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-11", "toId": "shape:ch09-y", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "end"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:THKQJ9T4SH2QRGpbpj-8r", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-4a", "toId": "shape:ch09-46", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "start"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 333.65333333333336, "y": 2551.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2a", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 455.04, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Same"}]}]}}, "index": "abVMX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2873.800000000003, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3b", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 174, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "green", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The borrower gains", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A feasible way to repay, without being declared a defaulter. It can focus on rebuilding the business and the balance sheet."}]}]}}, "index": "aOjxv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 917, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4c", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EXAM TRAP", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Relisting waiting periods, as per the SEBI (Delisting of Equity Shares) Regulations, 2009 cited in the book: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "5 years", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " after a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "voluntary", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " delisting, "}, {"type": "text", "text": "10 years", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " after a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "compulsory", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " one."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 168, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aFb6A", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5d", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-57", "props": {"color": "light-violet", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "3.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " You get a rights offer at a 30% discount but do not want to invest more. What are your choices?"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a6MTb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 56, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1a", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 128, "h": 128, "geo": "ellipse", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "white", "fill": "fill", "size": "l", "font": "sans", "align": "middle", "verticalAlign": "middle", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.4", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a1vUJ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 796.6933333333334, "y": 2551.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2b", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Same"}]}]}}, "index": "acaQf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 2873.800000000003, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3c", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 174, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "green", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The lender gains", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Some repayment on a loan that would otherwise be written off as a bad debt."}]}]}}, "index": "aPnif", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1435.3999999999942, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4d", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.13 Share swap"}]}]}}, "index": "aGWsI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1040, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5e", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-57", "props": {"color": "light-violet", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "4.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Why might promoters want to delist a profitable company? How do the rules protect minority shareholders?"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 24, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a7bbM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1b", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bonus issue"}]}]}}, "index": "a2y5r", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1074.3466666666668, "y": 2551.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2c", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Same"}]}]}}, "index": "adpkn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 3073.800000000003, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3d", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-2n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The process: analyse the debt position, meet lenders, share current and future financials, and agree a workable plan backed by a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "concrete business plan", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}}, "index": "aQIYI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1510.3999999999942, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4e", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3v", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Swap means exchange. In a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "share swap", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", usually in a merger or acquisition, the acquirer pays with "}, {"type": "text", "text": "its own shares", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " instead of cash. Each shareholder of the acquired company gets a pre-set number of the acquirer's shares. Both companies must be valued accurately first, so the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "swap ratio", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " is fair."}]}]}}, "index": "aHHTE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 622.9600000000064, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5f", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-57", "props": {"color": "light-violet", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "5.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Pick a recent Indian demerger. Did the parts end up worth more than the whole?"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a8WwI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:v0lklecvaHGdRQhK6fP_v", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-13", "toId": "shape:ch09-10", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "end"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1c", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 9 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3CRf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2637.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2d", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 126, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Book's price example", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aeMRb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 4620, "y": 788.6, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3e", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 1576, "name": "9.11 Buyback of shares", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a5EME", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 6160, "y": 788.6, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4f", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 2513.840000000011, "name": "All exam traps in this chapter", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a7sNQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 0, "y": 0, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5g", "type": "text", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 1217.7777777777778, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 4.5, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 9: Corporate actions"}]}]}}, "index": "a9cHX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1d", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A "}, {"type": "text", "text": "bonus issue", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", also called an "}, {"type": "text", "text": "equity dividend", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", is an alternative to a cash dividend. Shareholders get new shares "}, {"type": "text", "text": "free", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". The company moves money from its reserves into paid-up capital. This is called "}, {"type": "text", "text": "capitalisation of reserves", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}}, "index": "a4YII", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 333.65333333333336, "y": 2637.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2e", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 455.04, "h": 126, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1:1 bonus: Rs 1,000 to about Rs 500. 100 × 1,000 = 200 × 500"}]}]}}, "index": "afJWj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 56, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3f", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"w": 128, "h": 128, "geo": "ellipse", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "white", "fill": "fill", "size": "l", "font": "sans", "align": "middle", "verticalAlign": "middle", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.11", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a1SzB", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 56, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4g", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"w": 128, "h": 128, "geo": "ellipse", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "white", "fill": "fill", "size": "l", "font": "sans", "align": "middle", "verticalAlign": "middle", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "!", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a1B5X", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 0, "y": 295.5, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5h", "type": "text", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "l", "w": 3425, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.6, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "NISM Series XV Research Analyst  ·  Worth 5 marks of 100  ·  Book pages 187 to 197  ·  About 35 minutes  ·  Notes from the February 2026 workbook. Study aid only."}]}]}}, "index": "aAyTX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:5LRzd8Y9wD_j0EeUmOKuj", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-49", "toId": "shape:ch09-46", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "end"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 56, "y": 312, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1e", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ratio "}, {"type": "text", "text": "1:3", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " means 1 bonus share for every 3 shares held."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bonus is made only from "}, {"type": "text", "text": "free reserves built from genuine profits", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Reserves from "}, {"type": "text", "text": "revaluation of assets", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " cannot be used."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A company "}, {"type": "text", "text": "cannot", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " issue bonus shares if it has defaulted on interest or principal of any debt security or fixed deposit."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No money changes hands, so the value of the holding is the same before and after. The book says bonus issues mainly influence investor "}, {"type": "text", "text": "psychology", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", with no economic impact."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "a5UzwV", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "page:page", "name": "Chapter 9: Corporate actions", "index": "a1", "typeName": "page"}, {"x": 796.6933333333334, "y": 2637.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2f", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 126, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "SBI: above Rs 2,700 to about Rs 295 (1 share became 10)"}]}]}}, "index": "agUiP", "typeName": "shape"}, {"gridSize": 10, "name": "", "meta": {}, "id": "document:document", "typeName": "document"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3g", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Buyback of shares"}]}]}}, "index": "a2kGr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4h", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "All exam traps in this chapter"}]}]}}, "index": "a22U7", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 0, "y": 413.9, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5i", "type": "text", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 3044.4444444444443, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.8, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What a company does to its shares and its shareholders: pay them, give them more shares, buy shares back, merge, split up, or leave the stock exchange."}]}]}}, "index": "aBiyM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 312, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1f", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "light-green", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ANALOGY", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cutting a pizza into more slices. You have more slices, each one smaller, and exactly the same amount of pizza."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 24, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a6LIz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1074.3466666666668, "y": 2637.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2g", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 126, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "5:1: Rs 5 to about Rs 25. 500 × 5 = 100 × 25"}]}]}}, "index": "ahoLE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3h", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 9 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3b2A", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4i", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Read these the night before. Each one is a question waiting to happen"}]}]}}, "index": "a3mUk", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 5680, "y": 20, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5j", "type": "note", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EXAM TRAP", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A point the exam likes to twist"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 2.2, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aCyxQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 493.3333333333333, "y": 402, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-a", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "SEBI regulations", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a7xOX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:jeW24-FUjPaLiK3SNR3_Q", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-11", "toId": "shape:ch09-x", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "start"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 56, "y": 643.1999999999971, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1g", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.5 Stock split"}]}]}}, "index": "a72m6", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2771.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2h", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Why companies do it", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aiF16", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3i", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A company with spare cash can grow the business, repay borrowings, or return money to shareholders. To return it, it can pay a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "dividend", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " to everyone equally, or offer a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "buyback", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": shareholders choose whether to sell shares back, and those who stay get a higher EPS and book value per share."}]}]}}, "index": "a4AEX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4j", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Corporate actions are governed by the Companies Act 2013, SEBI regulations and the listing agreement."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 24, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a4U8zV", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 6160, "y": 20, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5k", "type": "note", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "light-green", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ANALOGY", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "An everyday picture of the idea"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 2.2, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aDRcz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 930.6666666666666, "y": 402, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-b", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The listing agreement", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Signed with the stock exchange"}]}]}}, "index": "a8peE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 718.1999999999971, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1h", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A "}, {"type": "text", "text": "stock split", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " reduces the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "face value", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " of each share in a set ratio. Split "}, {"type": "text", "text": "1:5", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " means one share becomes five, and face value falls to one fifth. The book's example: 100 shares of Rs 10 become 500 shares of Rs 2. Share capital does not change (more shares × lower face value)."}]}]}}, "index": "a8pib", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 333.65333333333336, "y": 2771.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2i", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 455.04, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Alternative to a cash dividend; investor psychology"}]}]}}, "index": "ajYPv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 358, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3j", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Six motives for a buyback"}]}]}}, "index": "a5atA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4k", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Eligibility is decided by the record date or book closure."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a54vM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 6640, "y": 20, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5l", "type": "note", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "light-blue", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "WHY IT MATTERS", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The reason behind a rule"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 2.2, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aEze1", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 542, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-c", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "These include giving notice to regulators and stakeholders and following disclosure norms."}]}]}}, "index": "a9DdM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 840.1999999999971, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1i", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Companies split when the share price is so high that it limits participation. A lower price per share brings "}, {"type": "text", "text": "greater liquidity", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Like a bonus, it is a book entry with no economic benefit."}]}]}}, "index": "a9PSA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 796.6933333333334, "y": 2771.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2j", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Price too high; improve liquidity"}]}]}}, "index": "ak4y6", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 433, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3k", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "As listed in the book"}]}]}}, "index": "a6PQ2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4l", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "3.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Dividends must be paid within 30 days of declaration."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a6MEv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 7120, "y": 20, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5m", "type": "note", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "yellow", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "REMEMBER", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A number or date to learn. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Highlighted", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " text means the same."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 2.2, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aFUh3", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 614, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-d", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Who gets the benefit?"}]}]}}, "index": "aAQzP", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:dpqINSsNHXdOHlLk6ql3w", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch09-49", "toId": "shape:ch09-45", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "start"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 840.1999999999971, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-1j", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"color": "light-blue", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The book's SBI example", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "SBI split its shares from Rs 10 face value to Re 1. One share became ten. The share traded above Rs 2,700 at the announcement and around Rs 295 after the split, so one share's worth of holding went from about Rs 2,700 to Rs 2,950 (10 × 295). After a split, the price depends on demand and supply."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 384, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aAcDA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1074.3466666666668, "y": 2771.399999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-2k", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-19", "props": {"w": 269.65333333333336, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Price too low; improve perception"}]}]}}, "index": "alFzm", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 491, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-3l", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3e", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Give the stock a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "value boost", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " if it looks undervalued"}]}]}}, "index": "a7D7n", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1040, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-4m", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch09-4f", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "4.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " SEBI: listed companies declare dividends in rupees per share, not as a % of face value."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a7mW2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 5680, "y": 500.00000000000006, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-5n", "type": "text", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "l", "w": 1342.857142857143, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.4, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Frames read top to bottom, then left to right. Zoom into one frame at a time."}]}]}}, "index": "aGRsA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 689, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch09-e", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch09-3", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Investors whose names appear in the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "register of members", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (physical shares) or the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "register of beneficial owners", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " kept by the depository (demat shares). To decide this, the company announces a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "record date", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " or a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "book closure", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " period. Those on the records on that date are eligible."}]}]}}, "index": "aBygE", "typeName": "shape"}]}